Calm down.

196
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:10,217
You have to fight Usopp.

197
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,197
Shut up.

198
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,617
I've given all I've got.

199
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:14,897
There's no way I can win against her.

200
