motivation regardless think

205
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:32,777
carefully don't you find
her behavior a little odd?

206
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:37,257
Yeah that's been bugging me especially
how she got so confident all of a sudden

207
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,477
she was completely terrified of me and

208
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:44,897
running for her life back there if she

209
00:11:44,980 --> 00:11:48,397
was impervious to my attacks all along
there was no point in running for me

210
