like that she could have just flown away
or walk right through one of the walls.

211
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,180
But she didn't.

212
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:57,497
All she did was run away
screaming at the top of her lungs.

213
00:11:57,580 --> 00:12:00,137
What was she freaking out
about if I couldn't hit her?

214
00:12:00,220 --> 00:12:01,050
That's it!

215
00:12:01,980 --> 00:12:02,940
Ruff! Ruff!

216
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:04,690
Gah!

217
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:09,949
Everything about her changed
the moment I lost sight of her.

218
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,740
