with that stupid zombie bear!

220
00:12:27,460 --> 00:12:30,695
That's when it happened right
when I lost sight of her?

221
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:37,780
Well, I guess I better hand you
over to Moria now. That's it.

222
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,200
I've got it

223
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,360
Look carefully.

224
00:12:42,260 --> 00:12:45,025
There's gotta be someplace
to hide around here!

225
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:48,000
