228
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:54,910
What?

229
00:12:54,993 --> 00:12:56,249
Are those your last words?

230
00:12:58,860 --> 00:12:59,880
Wait, stop!

231
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:02,219
What do you think you're aiming at?

232
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,430
That!

233
00:13:05,300 --> 00:13:06,297
No, hang on!

234
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:07,968
Special attack Atlas Comet!

235
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:28,640
Just as I expected.

236
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,317
There it is.

237
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:35,500
I found your real body, ghost girl.

238
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,917
I can see you playing a stick.

239
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:42,837
But you can fly.

240
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,157
You can walk straight
through walls and people.

241
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,157
And to top it off.

242
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,697
You can change your size at will.

243
00:13:47,780 --> 00:13:49,757
