244
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,857
But it sure sounds like
you're a ghost to me.

245
00:13:51,940 --> 00:13:58,397
So the question is: why would a
ghost run away from me? Like you did.

246
00:13:58,480 --> 00:14:00,837
Leave me alone.

247
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:05,377
The only thing that makes sense is
that you had a physical body when.

248
00:14:05,460 --> 00:14:06,297
I was chasing you.

249
00:14:06,380 --> 00:14:10,377
What's your point?

250
00:14:10,460 --> 00:14:13,797
My point is: you're a ghost duplicate.

251
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:16,117
You slipped out of your
body and became a ghost.

252
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,457
As soon as I lost sight of you.

253
00:14:17,540 --> 00:14:19,377
That right there.

254
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:20,797
That's your real body.

255
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,777
