leaving my body empty.

264
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:50,377
Thanks for explaining.

265
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:51,797
I'm just curious.

266
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:55,817
What do you think would happen if
you didn't have a body to go back to?

267
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:58,757
Because I've got a feeling that my attacks

268
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,917
are actually going to
hit this time around.

269
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,237
You bastard.

270
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,497
Don't you dare!

271
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:04,777
I'll blow you to bits.

272
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,507
Here comes my big bang star.

273
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:12,560
That was way too close.

274
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:13,800
But you missed.

275
00:15:13,980 --> 00:15:16,197
And it looks like it was a dud anyway.

276
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,339
This one won't be.

277
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:19,761
Like I'm giving you another shot.

278
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:21,260
Special hollow.

279
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:26,300
That one isn't going to
blow up, is it? Mini hollow.

280
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:32,160
A giant version of the ones from before.

281
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,780
Oh, this is messed up.

282
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:37,864
Get this thing off me, damn it.

283
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,117
You just stay put.

284
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:41,977
I'm not letting you lay
a finger on my real body.

285
00:15:42,060 --> 00:15:44,677
Hey, come on, wait,
can't we talk about this?

286
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:46,917
Those little ones are turning up already.

287
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,797
Can't you just use those on me again?

288
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,998
This big one will blow me to pieces!

289
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,317
You can struggle all you want.

290
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:54,280
It won't help.

291
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,800
You're inside a ghost.

292
00:16:05,660 --> 00:16:06,490
Ah!

293
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:07,510
Let me go!

294
00:16:07,593 --> 00:16:09,380
Let me out of this damn thing!

295
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:14,900
Too bad you mucked up
that shot, Long Nose.

296
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:19,197
With a simple snap of my fingers, you'll
be reduced to a puddle of guts and goo.

297
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:21,180
No! Please don't! Please!

298
00:16:21,620 --> 00:16:23,561
You won't stay that way for long.

299
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:27,537
Hogback will use whatever's left
of you to make a Long Nose zombie.

300
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:28,760
Kamikaze, wrap!

301
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,620
No! It vanished!

302
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,700
That was too close.

303
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:40,764
I used this impact dial
to absorb the explosion.

304
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:42,800
What are you...

305
00:16:44,300 --> 00:16:45,130
Huh?

306
00:16:45,213 --> 00:16:46,727
What the hell is this stuff?

307
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:49,237
It's a bluff. What do you mean?

308
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:53,517
You see, that shot I took at you earlier
landed exactly where I wanted it to.

309
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:55,188
And it wasn't a dud either.

310
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,556
It was actually a sticky star bullet.

311
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:01,137
I made sure you couldn't move after
you returned to your real body.

312
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:02,320
You did what?

313
00:17:02,620 --> 00:17:04,317
Now that your ghost and body are one...

314
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,377
I can kill two birds with one shot.

315
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:07,290
Damn it.

316
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:12,200
You're the one who purified
our Captain Kumasi, aren't you?

317
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:13,820
What perfect timing.

318
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:16,737
Now take the creep out,
Lieutenant Hippo gentlemen.

319
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:17,650
Get back.

320
00:17:17,940 --> 00:17:18,770
Oh.

321
00:17:23,020 --> 00:17:25,700
Wait, is he actually strong after all?

322
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:28,420
So much pain.

323
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,860
I feel like my arm's going to snap it too.

324
00:17:32,860 --> 00:17:34,680
Lieutenant Hippo!

325
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:40,760
Special attack!

326
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:43,500
Shiny Black Star!

327
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,510
Cockroaches!

328
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:05,426
Also known as the Roach Star!

329
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:06,880
So disgusting!

330
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:10,140
Get them off of me!

331
00:18:10,540 --> 00:18:11,400
Help me!

332
00:18:11,540 --> 00:18:12,880
I can't get away!

333
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:18,205
They're getting in my clothes!

334
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:20,157
Please, I hate cockroaches!

335
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,900
Please, somebody kill Lucy!

336
00:18:33,560 --> 00:18:36,660
I had a feeling cockroaches
would freak you out.

337
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:41,389
But if you want to know what
you really should be scared of?

338
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:42,974
You're looking at him.

339
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:46,900
You shouldn't have
underestimated me, princess.

340
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:50,217
I was known through the
entire stretch of East Blue.

341
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:52,817
As the strongest man who ever lived.

342
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:53,740
Ten tons?

343
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:57,817
How can you even fit that much
strength in that scrawny body of yours?

344
00:18:57,900 --> 00:19:02,180
I don't even have a chance, I
can't move Please, please stop!

345
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:04,940
Please don't!

346
00:19:05,100 --> 00:19:06,457
I'll die if you hit me with that!

347
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:08,857
And get these disgusting roaches off me!

348
00:19:08,940 --> 00:19:10,057
Not the hammer, please!

349
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:11,437
Not the cockroaches, either!

350
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:12,500
Please! Please!

351
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:20,080
Please spare my life! I'm sorry!

352
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:21,477
I'm begging you, please!

353
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:24,257
I swear I won't lay a finger on
your crew if you let me live!

354
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:25,397
Please don't kill me!

355
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,310
Please!

356
00:19:26,393 --> 00:19:27,223
Stop crying!

357
00:19:27,306 --> 00:19:28,136
It's too late!

358
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,840
GOLDEN POUND!

359
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,060
That is one sad ghost princess.

360
00:19:56,520 --> 00:19:58,857
Though she should be
ashamed of herself passing

361
00:19:58,940 --> 00:20:01,881
out at the sight of some
toy roaches in a balloon.

362
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:08,440
Talk about a stupid move.

363
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:12,720
Nobody challenges Usopp in the art
of negativity and lying and wins!

364
00:20:17,040 --> 00:20:19,240
You just stay put until sunrise!

365
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:45,640
You hear that?

366
00:20:45,900 --> 00:20:48,429
It sounded like the
samurai said something.

367
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,980
I couldn't understand.

368
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:53,340
A better question.

369
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,621
What in the hell's going on here?

370
00:20:56,420 --> 00:20:57,537
What's going on?

371
00:20:57,620 --> 00:21:00,940
In short, it looks like the
battle between them's over.

372
00:21:01,500 --> 00:21:03,417
I've seen many fights in my life,

373
00:21:03,500 --> 00:21:06,971
but I assure you none of them
have been anything like this.

374
00:21:23,020 --> 00:21:27,079
So you think you can take my black
blade Chess away from me, do you?

375
00:21:27,620 --> 00:21:28,679
Oh, I'm taking it.

376
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:33,780
I'm about to cut you down and
wrench it from your cold, dead body.

377
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,280
Oh, I see.

378
00:21:35,660 --> 00:21:37,420
Feeling cocky today, are we?

379
00:21:38,580 --> 00:21:39,720
Whoa, easy.

380
00:21:40,060 --> 00:21:42,178
It's not a good idea to provoke him.

381
00:21:42,700 --> 00:21:46,300
It looks to me that you already
have three swords. True.

382
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,100
But one's broken.

383
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:52,420
And I've gotten used to carrying
three, so it feels weird not to.

384
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:54,190
See?

385
00:21:54,273 --> 00:21:55,940
I use three-sword style.

386
00:21:57,060 --> 00:21:59,560
Three-sword style, huh? Never heard of it.

387
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:01,485
Is it some sort of circus act?

388
00:22:03,780 --> 00:22:05,740
No, it's nothing like that.

389
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:09,057
I assure you it's too
bad I wish I could show

390
00:22:09,140 --> 00:22:11,377
you but I'll just beat
you with two swords.

391
00:22:11,460 --> 00:22:12,290
Interesting.

392
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,600
I can sense you're very skilled

393
00:22:15,140 --> 00:22:18,737
Feeling that I've long forgotten
is welling up inside me once more.

394
00:22:18,820 --> 00:22:22,557
It's as if I'm facing some sort
of a beast a savage animal!

395
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:25,777
The strange sensation echoing deep in my

396
00:22:25,860 --> 00:22:28,680
bones makes me feel as
if I'm dancing on air.

397
00:22:33,860 --> 00:22:35,120
That's right there!

398
00:22:45,620 --> 00:22:48,500
No bother to drive!

399
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:54,760
It's not a gun,

400
00:22:55,080 --> 00:22:57,077
it's a thrust, one of my techniques,

401
00:22:57,160 --> 00:23:00,395
but when I use it, it doesn't
do nearly as much damage.
